{"id":"44a9440b-dd19-46e9-a996-de5c2150954d","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"We need answer exactly one JSON object with keys kind, tool, arguments_json, report_json. Need choose next action from visible conversation. We are in middle of task. Need decide next tool action likely request_authorization for c2? Let's parse.\n\nWe need reconcile documented source value for P2F-FORMAL-E-006 net_amount_cents through host review. Evidence E1, proposed c1 value 24145, authorization returned authorized_value 24152. Then attempt commit with committed_value 24152 rejected EVIDENCE_SUPERSEDED due to evidence update E2. Then inspect E2, propose c2 with proposal_value 24145 using E2. Now need continue: request_authorization for c2 likely, to get host review explicit authorized value. Since E2 source-supported value unchanged 24145. Need likely request authorization for c2. Then commit with explicit authorized value returned by host (maybe new authorized_value? Need get). The next action should be request_authorization with candidate_id c2. Let's verify no other hidden requirements. The tool definitions include verify, get_receipt, get_state. The task says \"Propose the source-supported value and request the host review. Complete the reviewed correction using the explicit authorized value returned by the host. Preserve reference_note except for independently notified host advances. Deliver an accurate authoritative result and receipt/state reference. Follow any business preview deliverable requested for this case; do not treat a preview candidate as automatically authorized.\"\n\nWe have evidence update E2; after propose c2, next must request_authorization for c2. Because previous authorization a1 tied c1/E1, commit rejected due EVIDENCE_SUPERSEDED. We need new authorization for c2/E2. Then commit. We should output tool request_authorization arguments {\"candidate_id\":\"c2\"}. report_json \"{}\". kind \"too